    "prose": {
      "minimal": "Build a todo list app. Users register and log in, then add, edit, search and delete their todos.\n\nEndpoints: POST /api/auth/register, POST /api/auth/login, GET /api/todos, POST /api/todos,\nPATCH /api/todos/{id}, DELETE /api/todos/{id}.",
      "standard": "Build a todo list app with a JSON API under `/api` and a web frontend.\n\n- `POST /api/auth/register` creates an account from a username and a password.\n- `POST /api/auth/login` returns a token; the other endpoints require it as a bearer token.\n- `GET /api/todos` lists the user's todos as `{\"items\": [...]}`; `q` searches the titles.\n- `POST /api/todos` adds a todo with a title.\n- `PATCH /api/todos/{id}` changes the title or marks the todo done.\n- `DELETE /api/todos/{id}` removes a todo.\n\nEach user sees and changes only their own todos.",
      "exhaustive": "Build a todo list app with a JSON API under `/api` and a web frontend.\n\n- `POST /api/auth/register` creates an account from a username (at most 50 characters, unique) and a\n  password. It answers 201, 400 for invalid input and 409 when the username is taken.\n- `POST /api/auth/login` returns `{\"token\": ...}`, or 401 for wrong credentials. The other endpoints\n  require the token as a bearer token.\n- `GET /api/todos` lists the user's todos as `{\"items\": [...]}`; `q` searches the titles\n  (case-insensitive substring).\n- `POST /api/todos` adds a todo; the title is required and at most 200 characters (400 otherwise). It\n  answers 201 with the todo.\n- `PATCH /api/todos/{id}` changes the title or `done`. It answers 404 for an unknown todo.\n- `DELETE /api/todos/{id}` removes a todo and answers 204.\n\nEach user sees and changes only their own todos: a todo of another user answers 403 or 404."
    },
